<!DOCTYPE html>
    <html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" lang="en-US"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" /><title>Create an OpenID Connect (OIDC) identity provider in IAM - AWS Identity and Access Management</title><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" /><meta name="assets_root" content="/assets" /><meta name="target_state" content="id_roles_providers_create_oidc" /><meta name="default_state" content="id_roles_providers_create_oidc" /><link rel="icon" type="image/ico" href="/assets/images/favicon.ico" /><link rel="shortcut icon" type="image/ico" href="/assets/images/favicon.ico" /><link rel="canonical" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" /><link rel="alternate" type="text/markdown" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.md" title="Markdown version" /><meta name="description" content="Create an OpenID Connect (OIDC) identity provider that describes a trust relationship between an OIDC-compatible IdP and AWS." /><meta name="deployment_region" content="IAD" /><meta name="product" content="AWS Identity and Access Management" /><meta name="guide" content="User Guide" /><meta name="abstract" content="Control access to your AWS resources with user identity (authentication) and with policies that define specific permissions (authorization)." /><meta name="guide-locale" content="en_us" /><meta name="tocs" content="toc-contents.json" /><link rel="canonical" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/id_id/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="id-id" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/id_id/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="id" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/de_de/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="de-de" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/de_de/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="de" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="en-us" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="en" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/es_es/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="es-es" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/es_es/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="es" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fr_fr/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="fr-fr" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fr_fr/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="fr" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/it_it/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="it-it" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/it_it/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="it" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ja_jp/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="ja-jp" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ja_jp/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="ja" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ko_kr/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="ko-kr" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ko_kr/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="ko" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/pt_br/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="pt-br" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/pt_br/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="pt" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/zh_cn/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="zh-cn" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/zh_tw/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="zh-tw" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_providers_create_oidc.html" hreflang="x-default" /><meta name="feedback-item" content="IAM" /><meta name="this_doc_product" content="AWS Identity and Access Management" /><meta name="this_doc_guide" content="User Guide" /><head xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"> <script defer="" src="/assets/r/awsdocs-doc-page.2.0.0.js"></script><link href="/assets/r/awsdocs-doc-page.2.0.0.css" rel="stylesheet"/></head>
